  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-junio-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Determina un polinomio \\(P(x)\\) de segundo grado sabiendo que \\(P(0)=P(2)=1\\) y \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^2P(x)\\,dx=\\frac13\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(P(x)=ax^2+bx+c\\). \\(P(0)=c=1\\); \\(P(2)=4a+2b+1=1\\iff b=-2a\\).</p>\\[\\int_0^2(ax^2-2ax+1)\\,dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{ax^3}3-ax^2+x\\Bigr]_0^2=\\frac{8a}3-4a+2=2-\\frac{4a}3=\\frac13\\iff a=\\frac54\\]<div class='res'>\\(P(x)=\\dfrac54x^2-\\dfrac52x+1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "def",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2002-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-junio-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Determina una matriz \\(A\\) simétrica (\\(A\\) coincide con su traspuesta) sabiendo que \\(\\det(A)=-7\\) y \\(A\\begin{pmatrix}2&6\\\\-1&-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&-12\\\\1&3\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Simétrica: \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\b&c\\end{pmatrix}\\).</p>\\[\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\b&c\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&6\\\\-1&-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2a-b&6a-3b\\\\2b-c&6b-3c\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4&-12\\\\1&3\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>La 2.ª columna es el triple de la 1.ª, así que solo hay dos condiciones: \\(2a-b=-4\\) y \\(2b-c=1\\). De ahí \\(b=2a+4\\) y \\(c=4a+7\\).</p>\\[\\det A=ac-b^2=a(4a+7)-(2a+4)^2=-9a-16=-7\\iff a=-1\\]<p>Entonces \\(b=2\\) y \\(c=3\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&2\\\\2&3\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "ecmat",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "det",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2002-JUNIO.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-junio-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula la ecuación de una recta que pasa por el punto de intersección del plano \\(\\pi\\equiv x+y-z+6=0\\) con la recta \\(s\\equiv\\dfrac x3=y-2=z+1\\) y es paralela a la recta \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}3x+y-4=0\\\\4x-3y+z-1=0\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Punto de corte:</b> \\(s\\equiv(3t,\\,2+t,\\,-1+t)\\). En \\(\\pi\\): \\(3t+2+t+1-t+6=0\\iff3t+9=0\\iff t=-3\\): \\(Q(-9,-1,-4)\\).</p><p><b>Director de </b>\\(r\\)<b>:</b> \\((3,1,0)\\times(4,-3,1)=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\3&1&0\\\\4&-3&1\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,-3,\\,-13)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-111,\"el\":32,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-12.0,-2.0,-5.0],[2.4,2.8,-0.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.4,2.8,-0.2],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[-9.4,0.2,1.2],[-8.6,-2.2,-9.2],\"#e11d48\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-8.6,-2.2,-9.2],\"t\",\"#e11d48\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[-9.179,2.669,-0.51],[-5.331,-1.179,-0.51],[-7.321,-3.169,-4.49],[-11.169,0.679,-4.49]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-7.321,-3.169,-4.49],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"pt\",[-9,-1,-4],\"Q\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02ja4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02ja4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02ja4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02ja4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='29.5' y1='189.6' x2='248.6' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='254.6' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='60.1' y1='61.7' x2='90.1' y2='246.0' stroke='#e11d48' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='96.1' y='246.0' fill='#e11d48' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>t</text><polygon points='47.4,65.2 140.4,87.2 119.0,175.7 26.0,153.8' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='123.0' y='175.7' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><circle cx='75.1' cy='153.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='82.1' y='147.9' font-weight='700'>Q</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='38.9' y2='267.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='41.2' y='269.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='18.3' y2='262.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='13.3' y='263.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='256.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='255.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(\\begin{cases}x=-9+\\lambda\\\\y=-1-3\\lambda\\\\z=-4-13\\lambda\\end{cases}\\), \\(\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R\\)</div></div>"
    }
