  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-junio-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{9x-3}{x^2-2x}\\) para \\(x\\neq0\\) y \\(x\\neq2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Calcula las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Con los datos obtenidos, esboza la gráfica de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> el denominador \\(x(x-2)\\) se anula en \\(0\\) y \\(2\\), y el numerador no: \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=\\frac{-3}0=\\infty\\), \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to2}f(x)=\\frac{15}0=\\infty\\). <b>Horizontal:</b> \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to\\pm\\infty}\\frac{9x-3}{x^2-2x}=0\\): \\(y=0\\).</p><div class='res'>Asíntotas verticales \\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\); asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(x=0\\) y \\(x=2\\) son puntos «problemáticos»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>:</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{9(x^2-2x)-(9x-3)(2x-2)}{(x^2-2x)^2}=\\frac{-9x^2+6x-6}{(x^2-2x)^2}=\\frac{-3(3x^2-2x+2)}{(x^2-2x)^2}\\]<p>\\(3x^2-2x+2\\gt0\\) siempre (discriminante \\(4-24\\lt0\\)): \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\) en todo el dominio.</p><div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>0</text><circle cx='96' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><circle cx='178' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(−1) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(1) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M207.0 10L243.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 39L243.0 40L241.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &lt; 0</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(f\\) es decreciente en \\((-\\infty,0)\\), en \\((0,2)\\) y en \\((2,+\\infty)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Corta al eje en \\(x=\\frac13\\). Decrece siempre, con asíntotas \\(x=0\\), \\(x=2\\) e \\(y=0\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,127.9 21.0,128.0 22.0,128.1 23.0,128.1 24.0,128.2 25.0,128.3 26.1,128.4 27.1,128.6 28.1,128.7 29.1,128.8 30.1,128.9 31.1,129.0 32.1,129.1 33.1,129.2 34.1,129.3 35.1,129.4 36.1,129.6 37.1,129.7 38.2,129.8 39.2,129.9 40.2,130.0 41.2,130.2 42.2,130.3 43.2,130.4 44.2,130.6 45.2,130.7 46.2,130.9 47.2,131.0 48.2,131.2 49.3,131.3 50.3,131.5 51.3,131.6 52.3,131.8 53.3,131.9 54.3,132.1 55.3,132.3 56.3,132.5 57.3,132.6 58.3,132.8 59.3,133.0 60.4,133.2 61.4,133.4 62.4,133.6 63.4,133.8 64.4,134.0 65.4,134.2 66.4,134.4 67.4,134.7 68.4,134.9 69.4,135.1 70.4,135.4 71.4,135.6 72.5,135.9 73.5,136.2 74.5,136.4 75.5,136.7 76.5,137.0 77.5,137.3 78.5,137.6 79.5,137.9 80.5,138.3 81.5,138.6 82.5,139.0 83.6,139.3 84.6,139.7 85.6,140.1 86.6,140.5 87.6,140.9 88.6,141.4 89.6,141.8 90.6,142.3 91.6,142.8 92.6,143.4 93.6,143.9 94.7,144.5 95.7,145.1 96.7,145.8 97.7,146.4 98.7,147.2 99.7,147.9 100.7,148.8 101.7,149.6 102.7,150.6 103.7,151.6 104.7,152.7 105.7,153.9 106.8,155.2 107.8,156.6 108.8,158.2 109.8,160.0 110.8,162.1 111.8,164.4 112.8,167.0 113.8,170.2 114.8,173.9 115.8,178.5 116.8,184.2 117.9,191.8 118.9,202.1 119.9,217.3 120.9,242.0' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='125.6,-52.3 126.1,-4.6 126.5,24.8 127.0,44.8 127.5,59.3 128.0,70.3 128.5,79.0 129.0,86.1 129.5,92.0 130.0,96.9 130.5,101.2 131.0,105.0 131.5,108.3 131.9,111.2 132.4,113.9 132.9,116.3 133.4,118.5 133.9,120.5 134.4,122.4 134.9,124.2 135.4,125.9 135.9,127.5 136.4,129.0 136.9,130.4 137.4,131.8 137.8,133.2 138.3,134.5 138.8,135.7 139.3,136.9 139.8,138.1 140.3,139.3 140.8,140.5 141.3,141.6 141.8,142.7 142.3,143.9 142.8,145.0 143.3,146.1 143.7,147.2 144.2,148.3 144.7,149.5 145.2,150.6 145