   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=xe^{-x}\\). Esboza el recinto limitado por la curva \\(y=f(x)\\), los ejes coordenados y la recta \\(x=-1\\). Calcula su área.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Entre \\(x=-1\\) y \\(x=0\\), \\(f(x)=xe^{-x}\\leq0\\): el recinto está bajo el eje.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 200' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='52.5,52.0 54.1,52.0 55.8,52.0 57.4,52.0 59.0,52.0 60.6,52.0 62.2,52.0 63.9,52.0 65.5,52.0 67.1,52.0 68.8,52.0 70.4,52.0 72.0,52.0 73.6,52.0 75.2,52.0 76.9,52.0 78.5,52.0 80.1,52.0 81.8,52.0 83.4,52.0 85.0,52.0 86.6,52.0 88.2,52.0 89.9,52.0 91.5,52.0 93.1,52.0 94.8,52.0 96.4,52.0 98.0,52.0 99.6,52.0 101.2,52.0 102.9,52.0 104.5,52.0 106.1,52.0 107.8,52.0 109.4,52.0 111.0,52.0 112.6,52.0 114.2,52.0 115.9,52.0 117.5,52.0 117.5,52.0 115.9,53.0 114.2,54.1 112.6,55.2 111.0,56.4 109.4,57.7 107.8,59.0 106.1,60.3 104.5,61.8 102.9,63.3 101.2,64.8 99.6,66.5 98.0,68.2 96.4,70.0 94.8,71.9 93.1,73.8 91.5,75.9 89.9,78.0 88.2,80.2 86.6,82.6 85.0,85.0 83.4,87.5 81.8,90.1 80.1,92.9 78.5,95.7 76.9,98.7 75.2,101.8 73.6,105.0 72.0,108.4 70.4,111.9 68.8,115.5 67.1,119.3 65.5,123.2 63.9,127.3 62.2,131.5 60.6,136.0 59.0,140.5 57.4,145.3 55.8,150.3 54.1,155.4 52.5,160.7' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='33.0,242.8 36.1,227.3 39.2,212.8 42.3,199.3 45.3,186.7 48.4,175.0 51.5,164.0 54.6,153.8 57.7,144.3 60.8,135.5 63.9,127.3 67.0,119.7 70.0,112.6 73.1,106.0 76.2,99.9 79.3,94.3 82.4,89.1 85.5,84.2 88.6,79.8 91.7,75.7 94.8,71.9 97.8,68.4 100.9,65.2 104.0,62.2 107.1,59.5 110.2,57.0 113.3,54.8 116.4,52.7 119.4,50.8 122.5,49.1 125.6,47.6 128.7,46.2 131.8,44.9 134.9,43.8 138.0,42.8 141.1,41.9 144.1,41.1 147.2,40.4 150.3,39.8 153.4,39.3 156.5,38.8 159.6,38.4 162.7,38.1 165.8,37.9 168.8,37.7 171.9,37.5 175.0,37.4 178.1,37.3 181.2,37.3 184.3,37.3 187.4,37.3 190.5,37.4 193.5,37.5 196.6,37.6 199.7,37.7 202.8,37.9 205.9,38.0 209.0,38.2 212.1,38.4 215.2,38.6 218.2,38.8 221.3,39.1 224.4,39.3 227.5,39.5 230.6,39.8 233.7,40.0 236.8,40.3 239.9,40.5 242.9,40.8 246.0,41.1 249.1,41.3 252.2,41.6 255.3,41.8 258.4,42.1 261.5,42.3 264.6,42.6 267.7,42.8 270.7,43.1 273.8,43.3 276.9,43.6 280.0,43.8' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='52.5' y1='180.0' x2='52.5' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='52.5' cy='160.7' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='58.5' y='174.7'>(−1,−e)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 52.0H294.0M117.5 194.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='52.5' y1='49.0' x2='52.5' y2='55.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='49.5' y='66.0' font-size='10'>-1</text><line x1='182.5' y1='49.0' x2='182.5' y2='55.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='179.5' y='66.0' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='247.5' y1='49.0' x2='247.5' y2='55.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='244.5' y='66.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='114.5' y1='132.0' x2='120.5' y2='132.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='101.5' y='136.0' font-size='10'>-2</text></svg></div><p>Por partes<i class='n' data-t='th'>Integración por partes: \\(\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du\\).</i> con \\(u=x\\), \\(dv=e^{-x}dx\\): \\(\\int xe^{-x}dx=-xe^{-x}+\\int e^{-x}dx=-(x+1)e^{-x}\\).</p>\\[\\int_{-1}^0xe^{-x}dx=\\Bigl[-(x+1)e^{-x}\\Bigr]_{-1}^0=-1-0=-1\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A=|-1|=1\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=1\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
