  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-junio-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Determina la matriz \\(X\\) que verifica la ecuación \\(AX=X-B\\) siendo \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&0&0\\\\-1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\) y \\(B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&-1&-1\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[AX=X-B\\iff AX-X=-B\\iff(A-I)X=-B\\]\\[M=A-I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & -1 & 0\\\\-1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|M|=\\begin{vmatrix}-1&0&1\\\\0&-1&0\\\\-1&0&-1\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-1+0+0\\bigr)-\\bigl(1+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\]<p>Como \\(|M|\\neq0\\), existe la inversa: \\(M^{-1}=\\dfrac1{|M|}(\\operatorname{Adj}M)^t\\).</p>\\[\\operatorname{Adj}M=\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow M^{-1}=-\\frac1{2}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 2 & 0\\\\-1 & 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}- \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{2}\\\\0 & -1 & 0\\\\\\frac{1}{2} & 0 & - \\frac{1}{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\]\\[X=M^{-1}(-B)=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & -2 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & -1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1 & 0 & -1\\\\0 & -1 & -1\\\\0 & 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1 & 0\\\\0 & 2 & 2\\\\-1 & -1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}\\]<div class='res'>\\(X=\\dfrac12\\begin{pmatrix}1 & -1 & 0\\\\0 & 2 & 2\\\\-1 & -1 & -2\\end{pmatrix}\\)</div></div>"
    }
